{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在心理因果和叙事衔接上有时不如Y自然完整，部分意象也稍显密集。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的加亮关键词让人不用读完所有句子就能抓住每段的叙事重点，小字感受和按乐句出现的提示也形成了阅读节奏。反复出现的水面、船身、摇荡等意象，把音乐变化和人物心理串在一起，感受的层次、身体细节及情绪转折也明显更丰富。Y的心理解释更顺畅、更容易直接理解，但部分音乐动态和细腻感受被压缩成了概括性的情绪描述，作为边听边看的体验，X整体更有层次。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "13e4ca2c-f8f1-451e-b85f-85caca8341a2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T005154116954Z", "elapsed_seconds": 150.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:54:24.548973+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1ef1a367edf8e7eac072e1c8cb2de8fa629e7becb72a726970c52e968452c30a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2388500